<title>USA: Monticello, Minn., school deal won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>Monticello, Minn., school deal won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Wednesday it won $33.1 million Independent School District No 882 Monticello, Minn., general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.42 percent.</p>
</text>
